shortdesc A BibLaTeX style emulating Springer's old spbasic.bst
longdesc This package provides a bibliography and citation style for
longdesc BibLaTeX/biber for typesetting articles for Springer's
longdesc journals. It is the same as the old BibTeX style spbasic.bst.
